ith the types unknown and never (and more rarely, just bare null and undefined) can no longer be spread into JSX elements.\r\nhttps://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/release-notes/typescript-4-7.html#stricter-spread-checks-in-jsx\r\n\r\nUnconstrained Generics No Longer Assignable to {}\r\nhttps://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/announcing-typescript-4-8-beta/#unconstrained-generics-no-longer-assignable-to\r\n<!--\r\n!!! Please read the following content if this is your first pull request !!!\r\n\r\n1. If you are working on docs, please set `docs` branch as the target branch.\r\n2. If you are working on bug fixes or new features, please set `main` branch as the target branch.\r\n\r\nFor people who are working on 2, please add changelog to `CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md` & `CHANGELOG.en-US.md` in the PR. You need to add changelog to both files. You can use English in both file. The develop team will translate it later.\r\n\r\nAbout docs & changelog's format and other tips, see in `CONTRIBUTING.md`.\r\n-->\r\n<!--\r\n!!! 如果这是你第一次提交 PR，请阅读下面的内容 !!!\r\n\r\n1. 如果你在修改文档，请提交到 `docs` 分支\r\n2. 如果你在修复 Bug 或者开发新的特性，请提交到 `main` 分支\r\n\r\n对于进行工作 2 的人，请在 `CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md` & `CHANGELOG.en-US.md` 中添加变更日志，你需要在两个文件中都添加变更日志。你可以只使用中文，开发团队会在之后进行翻译。\r\n\r\n关于文档和变更日志的格式以及其他的帮助信息，请参考 `CONTRIBUTING.md`。\r\n-->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tusen-ai/naive-ui/issues/3654/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tusen-ai/naive-ui/issues/3654/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":7318658515,"node_id":"REFE_lADOCCum185Qn922zwAAAAG0Od3T","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/7318658515","actor":{"login":"SalHe","id":8342541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDI1NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8342541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SalHe","htm